# Circuit build output. The proving key is ~20 MB and the ptau is larger; both
# are reproducible from scripts/setup.mjs. The verification key and the
# generated Verifier.sol are the artefacts that matter and they are committed.
# The proving key is ~20 MB and is NOT reproducible — the phase-2
# contribution used randomness, and the deployed verifier was generated from
# that exact file. Its SHA-256 is recorded in the README so anyone can verify
# the copy they downloaded, without the repo carrying the bytes.
circuits/build/
!circuits/build/verification_key.json
web/public/circuit/

